msgid "Radio Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:7
#: 1df6c82baab942ab971793a4dcf0b348
msgid "Due to the RF attenuation of even a short distance of water above a submersible, radio control must be accomplished by floating tethered buoy to the vehicle which contains the RF components and antenna. This applies also to RF based telemetry, whether independent of, or integrated into, the radio control system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:9
#: 209280dbc91d4a698f9a134df0de5300
msgid "To enable radio control, the :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` parameter must be set to a non-zero value, \"1\" is usually used. If rc control of the flight mode is desired, in addition to axis/directional control, the :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` should be set to the RC channel that will control flight modes, if this is desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:11
#: aa6d3c2a72e3407487b977581c9918eb
msgid "Any ArduPilot compatible :ref:`radio control system<common-rc-systems>` can be employed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:14
#: a06a5f863bf74d41878ab86e37ce6977
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:16
#: 65c9c1048e8f4ca0be732fc6f16aae54
msgid "The mapping of which incoming RC channel controls which axis/directional control is fixed when GCS only control is used, however, these can be remapped using :ref:`common-rcmap`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:18
#: 6a5d913ffd00459e808852fdf99de6a0
msgid "If a flight mode switch is used, it can be setup as following :ref:`common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rc-setup.rst:20
#: 1e03a74dce294047a04b91d0820a1b49
msgid "In place of the Sub ``BTNx`` functions activated from the GCS, :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` can be setup, controlled via RC transmitter switches."
msgstr ""

